{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pizza Aunty</strong> is a story-driven <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about a late-night delivery that turns into a nightmare.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/6fba0901833563251def2b83da8a4860.avif?t=1774091866\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>pizza boy</strong> working one last shift. The customer \u2014 a woman with a strange, demanding voice \u2014 insists you bring her order. Against your better judgment, you accept. The delivery leads you to a large, isolated house. Once you step inside, the door locks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.......................................................................................................................................................................................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is dark, filthy, and filled with whispers. Aunty is waiting. She knows your name. She knows it\u2019s your birthday. She calls out to you like family\u2026 but you\u2019ve never met her before. Why does she see you as her enemy? What happened to her daughter? And why does she act like you\u2019ve been here before? <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is a night of <strong>fear, confusion, and psychological torment.</strong> Every room tells a story of loss and obsession. Every sound keeps you on edge. And Aunty\u2019s haunting voice never lets you feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/6a31b0cd877082e02c61ed955309f4df.avif?t=1774091866\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras_big/6a31b0cd877082e02c61ed955309f4df.webp?t=1774091866 width=1560 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/3cd6e908f9f9ec348eb9cc4aaa73b083.poster.avif?t=1774091866\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/3cd6e908f9f9ec348eb9cc4aaa73b083.webm?t=1774091866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/3cd6e908f9f9ec348eb9cc4aaa73b083.mp4?t=1774091866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/38bc4fa14e76d4ea9ae45be7d9944afc.avif?t=1774091866\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras_big/38bc4fa14e76d4ea9ae45be7d9944afc.webp?t=1774091866 width=1560 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/ebc17182bfbcbe5d8d44dbf08b77678d.poster.avif?t=1774091866\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/ebc17182bfbcbe5d8d44dbf08b77678d.webm?t=1774091866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/ebc17182bfbcbe5d8d44dbf08b77678d.mp4?t=1774091866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/b28760bfdccfe1f2dd098673bfa311b0.avif?t=1774091866\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras_big/b28760bfdccfe1f2dd098673bfa311b0.webp?t=1774091866 width=1560 height=223 /></span><strong> </strong>  <br>  <br><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person <strong>psychological horror</strong> experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional, story-rich atmosphere with a tragic backstory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental storytelling</strong> through disturbing details in the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy voice acting and unsettling encounters with Aunty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but intense gameplay, perfect for horror fans and streamers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983180?t=1774091866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/2040cb24831c2a99fc50b1194bfbc2278c1ce1e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774091866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/70337e47390d3ab2ffbe979169a6ad7360d0a876/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774091866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/70337e47390d3ab2ffbe979169a6ad7360d0a876/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774091866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains the following content that may not be suitable for all audiences:\r\n\r\n> Violence and Gore \u2013 Depictions of blood, dismembered bodies, and disturbing imagery.\r\n\r\n>Horror Elements \u2013 Psychological scares, stalking, and threatening situations.\r\n\r\n>Strong Language \u2013 Occasional use of harsh or unsettling dialogue.\r\n\r\n>Dark Themes \u2013 Includes isolation, fear, and disturbing environments that may be distressing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pizza Aunty</strong> is a story-driven <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about a late-night delivery that turns into a nightmare.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/6fba0901833563251def2b83da8a4860.avif?t=1774091866\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>pizza boy</strong> working one last shift. The customer \u2014 a woman with a strange, demanding voice \u2014 insists you bring her order. Against your better judgment, you accept. The delivery leads you to a large, isolated house. Once you step inside, the door locks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.......................................................................................................................................................................................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is dark, filthy, and filled with whispers. Aunty is waiting. She knows your name. She knows it\u2019s your birthday. She calls out to you like family\u2026 but you\u2019ve never met her before. Why does she see you as her enemy? What happened to her daughter? And why does she act like you\u2019ve been here before? <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is a night of <strong>fear, confusion, and psychological torment.</strong> Every room tells a story of loss and obsession. Every sound keeps you on edge. And Aunty\u2019s haunting voice never lets you feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983180/extras/6a31b0cd877082e02c61ed9