 horror game where a late-night pizza delivery takes a dark turn. Trapped inside a strange woman\u2019s house, you must explore, survive, and escape. Uncover secrets in an atmospheric, story-rich nightmare where every sound could be your last.","steam_appid":3983180,"support_info":{"email":"contact@burqx.com","url":"https://www.burqx.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.burqx.com/"}